<title>UK: IBRD sets $100 million one-year bond.</title>
<headline>IBRD sets $100 million one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Wako International (Europe) Ltd and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p>BORROWER  INTERNATIONAL BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     5.8	 MATURITY    30.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.6438  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.5638    LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
